OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls on council to pay more to
OL,4,Asave ferry service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on a council to
OL,7,Freverse its decision not to increase
OL,8,Fits funding for a long-running ferry
OL,9,Fservice, which is due to cease
OL,10,Foperating next month.
OL,12,FLancashire Council County should, as
OL,13,Fthe authority overseeing transport, pay
OL,14,Fthe cost of running the Fleetwood to
OL,15,FKnott End ferry service.
OL,17,FBut under an agreement, it has shared
OL,18,Fthe cost with the district authority
OL,19,FWyre Council, paying half and half.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
