OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls on council to pay more to
OL,4,Asave ferry service
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith costs rising, the county council
OL,7,Fhas said it is unable to contribute
OL,8,Fmore, with highways and transport
OL,9,Fcabinet member Warren Goldsworthy
OL,10,Fsaying that doing so would take money
OL,11,Faway from other services, and Wyre
OL,12,FCouncil should be responsible.
